{"format":1,"key":"zone:dustwallow","path":"/lore/zone/dustwallow","name":"Dustwallow Marsh","kind":"zone","label":"Zone","zone":{"key":"dustwallow","name":"Dustwallow Marsh","path":"/lore/zone/dustwallow"},"levels":"","description":"Dustwallow Marsh is a vast, sweltering swampland in central Kalimdor, trapped between the arid plains of the Barrens and the Great Sea. Fed by perpetual…","intro":[],"clips":[{"id":"zone:dustwallow","part":"narration","anchor":"story","title":"The story","paras":["Dustwallow Marsh is a vast, sweltering swampland in central Kalimdor, trapped between the arid plains of the Barrens and the Great Sea. Fed by perpetual subterranean springs, its treacherous fens harbor dangerous predators, covert faction skirmishes, and the lurking presence of the black dragonflight. It serves as home to the Alliance fortress-island of Theramore in the east and the Horde-allied Stonemaul ogres of Brackenwall Village to the northwest.","Before the Great Sundering, Dustwallow was a high, grassy plain teeming with herd animals. The cataclysm shattered the valley, causing the water table to rise and drown the earth in endless stagnant pools, mossy shallows, and choking mud. Underground springs ensure the marsh remains perpetually humid and submerged, blanketed in thick fog and infested with crocolisks, raptors, and spiders. Jagged shallows and wandering bogs make travel perilous for any adventurer stepping off the crumbling causeways.","Dustwallow was largely wild until the aftermath of the Third War, when Lady Jaina Proudmoore led human refugees across the sea to establish the citadel of Theramore Isle on its eastern coast. Soon after, Kul Tiran forces under Grand Admiral Daelin Proudmoore waged war against Thrall's fledgling Horde, culminating in bloody battles across the wetlands and the Admiral's defeat. Today, an official armistice exists between Theramore and Orgrimmar, yet tension smolders beneath the surface. Theramore struggles with desertions and sabotage, while spies wage quiet, deadly conflicts across the fens."],"hash":"e88812","voices":{"male-narrator":{"sha":"7f205242bd","sec":93},"female-narrator":{"sha":"f9cdd1267f","sec":97}}}],"sources":[{"kind":"wiki","title":"Dustwallow Marsh (Classic)","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Dustwallow_Marsh_(Classic)"},{"kind":"wiki","title":"Dustwallow Marsh","url":"https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Dustwallow_Marsh"}],"related":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/theramore-isle","n":"Theramore Isle","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/brackenwall-village","n":"Brackenwall Village","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/onyxia-s-lair","n":"Onyxia's Lair","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/wyrmbog","n":"Wyrmbog","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/stonemaul-ruins","n":"Stonemaul Ruins","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/tabetha-s-farm","n":"Tabetha's Farm","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1241-the-missing-diplomat","n":"The Missing Diplomat","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/npc/red-jack-flint","n":"Red Jack Flint","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/npc/doctor-gustaf-vanhowzen","n":"Doctor Gustaf VanHowzen","k":"npc"},{"p":"/lore/quest/6625-alliance-trauma","n":"Alliance Trauma","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1132-fiora-longears","n":"Fiora Longears","k":"quest"},{"p":"/lore/quest/1135-highperch-venom","n":"Highperch Venom","k":"quest"}],"children":[{"p":"/lore/subzone/beezil-s-wreck","n":"Beezil's Wreck","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/bloodfen-burrow","n":"Bloodfen Burrow","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/bluefen","n":"Bluefen","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/brackenwall-village","n":"Brackenwall Village","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/darkmist-cavern","n":"Darkmist Cavern","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/den-of-flame","n":"Den of Flame","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/dragonmurk","n":"Dragonmurk","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/dreadmurk-shore","n":"Dreadmurk Shore","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/dustwallow-bay","n":"Dustwallow Bay","k":"subzone"},{"p":"/lore/subzone/foothold-citadel","n"